<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在看看小饭桌…</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="section-title">基本信息</view>
    <view class="card form">
      <view class="avatar-setting"><view class="avatar-editor" bindtap="chooseAvatar"><image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="avatar avatar-large">{{nickname[0]||'饭'}}</view><view class="avatar-mask">{{uploadingAvatar?(uploadStage==='compressing'?'压缩中':'上传中'):'更换头像'}}</view></view><view class="avatar-copy"><view>我的头像</view><text>照片会自动压缩到 2MB 以内</text><text wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" class="remove-avatar" bindtap="removeAvatar">恢复默认头像</text></view></view>
      <view class="field"><text>饭桌名称</text><input maxlength="50" value="{{name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input"/></view>
      <view class="field"><text>我的称呼</text><input maxlength="30" value="{{nickname}}" data-key="nickname" bindinput="input"/></view>
      <view class="field"><text>在一起日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{anniversary}}" bindchange="date"><view>{{anniversary||'暂未设置'}} ›</view></picker></view>
      <view class="copy-field"><text>首页主标题</text><textarea class="title-editor" maxlength="80" auto-height value="{{homeTitle}}" data-key="homeTitle" bindinput="input"/><view class="field-hint">前面会自动显示早上好、下午好或晚上好</view></view>
      <view class="copy-field"><text>首页副标题</text><textarea maxlength="120" auto-height value="{{homeSubtitle}}" data-key="homeSubtitle" bindinput="input"/></view>
      <button class="btn" bindtap="save">保存设置</button>
    </view>
    <view id="members" class="section-title">饭桌成员 · {{couple.members.length}} / 2</view>
    <view class="card members"><view wx:for="{{couple.members}}" wx:key="id" class="member"><image wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}" class="member-avatar" src="{{item.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="avatar">{{item.nickname[0]}}</view><view class="member-info"><view>{{item.nickname}}<text wx:if="{{item.id==currentUserId}}" class="me-tag">我</text></view><text>{{item.id==currentUserId?'可在上方修改自己的头像和称呼':(item.id===couple.createdBy?'创建者 · 仅查看':'对方 · 仅查看')}}</text></view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{couple.members.length<2}}" class="card invite"><view class="label">邀请另一半</view><view wx:if="{{couple.inviteCode}}" class="code">{{couple.inviteCode}}</view><view class="hint">邀请码有效期 7 天，只能再加入 1 人。</view><view class="invite-actions"><button wx:if="{{couple.inviteCode}}" bindtap="copy">复制邀请码</button><button bindtap="invite">{{couple.inviteCode?'换一个':'生成邀请码'}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="card switch-table" bindtap="switchTable"><text>切换小饭桌</text><text>查看并切换之前加入过的小饭桌 ›</text></view>
    <view class="danger"><view class="danger-title">离开小饭桌</view><view>退出只会移除你和这张饭桌的关系，饭桌与历史记录仍会保留。</view><button bindtap="leave">退出当前小饭桌</button><view class="danger-title delete-title">删除整张小饭桌</view><view>仅创建者且没有其他成员时可删除，菜单、订单和照片都会永久移除。</view><button class="delete-couple" bindtap="deleteCouple">永久删除小饭桌</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
